built-from: inbox-consult.json's task item and view (docket's own recorded fixture), the captured task item and view of inbox-waiting-escalation.json, the captured decided record of inbox-decided.json, and the consult task item turned into a running one (status running, a2aState WORKING, reason and escalation null)
