note: an inbox with everything in it at once: two waiting tasks (a consult and an approval), a running one, and a decided record. not captured, because docket sends it only while a model runs or a person answers one; every key is one docket writes, the values are made up, or come from the capture or the recording it is built from. The three tasks and two pending escalations have the ids ending 0, 1 and 2 so they can be told apart.
